{title: Darling Aankhon Se}
{artist: Usha Uthup Vishal Bharadwaj}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
Hey dar [A7]ling,        aank [A7]ho se aankhe cha [Dm]ar karne do
Dar [A7]ling aankho se aankhe cha [Dm]ar karne do
Dar [A7]ling aankho se aankhe cha [Dm]ar karne do
Roko [A7]na roko na mujhko [Dm]pyaar karne do
Dar [A7]ling aankho se aankhe cha [Dm]ar karne do
Roko [A7]na roko na mujhko [Dm]pyaar karne do
Bek [Gm]hauf hai bahara, be [F]chain jaane yaara
Bulbu [A7]lon ko bhi inte [Dm]zaar karne do
Dar [A7]ling aankho se aankhe cha [Dm]ar karne do
Dar [Dm]ling, sorry tujhe,        Sunday ke [A7]din, zehmat hui
Dar [Dm]ling, milna tera,        fazle khu [A7]da, rehmat hui
Dar [Dm]ling, sorry tujhe,        aate hu [C]e, sehmat hui
Dar [A7]ling, [D]milna tera,        faz [C]le khuda, reh [F]mat hui rehmat h [A7]ui
Hey dar [A7]ling, khatim ko,        dil par toh ikhte [Dm]yar karne do
Dar [A7]ling aankho se aankhe cha [Dm]ar karne do
Roko [A7]na roko na mujhko [Dm]pyaar karne do,        Dar [Dm]ling, chhodo zara,
sharmane [A7]ka, yeh qaayda,        Hey dar [Dm]ling, hairat bhi hai,
ghai [A7]rat bhi hai, kya fyada
Dar [Dm]ling chhodo zara sharmane [C]ka ye kayda
Dar [A7]ling hai [D]rat bhi hai,        ghai [C]rat bhi hai kya fya [F]da kya fayd [A7]a
Dar [A7]ling public me sansa [Dm]ni ekbar karnedo
Dar [A7]ling aankho se aankhe cha [Dm]ar karne do
Roko [A7]na roko na mujhko [Dm]pyaar karne do
Bek [Gm]hauf hai bahara, be [F]chain jaane yaara
Bulbu [A7]lon ko bhi inte [Dm]zaar karne do
Dar [A7]ling aankho se aankhe cha [Dm]ar karne do
